<title>USA: Willamette ups qtly dividend to $0.32/shr.</title>
<headline>Willamette ups qtly dividend to $0.32/shr.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Willamette Industries Inc's board declared a dividend of $0.32 per share on Willamette's common stock.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on March 14, 1997 to shareholders of record on February 24, 1997.  </p>
<p>This is an increase in the dividend from $0.31 a share.</p>
</text>
